{"scene_id": "s05195_0", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s05195.fountain", "heading": "INT. IRON TEMPLE GYM - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MO", "names": ["MO"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 7}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. IRON TEMPLE GYM - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Empty.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Dim emergency lights.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Rows of dead treadmills.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A neon sign above the juice bar flickers: NO PAIN NO GAIN.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A door SLAMS somewhere deep inside the building.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Footsteps.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Then a figure comes through the locker room entrance in a black hoodie and gym bag, moving fast.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo, 30s, wiry, nervous hands.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "He drops the bag onto a bench and unzips it.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside: a stethoscope, a tablet, a roll of thermal paper, an old key on a lanyard.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "He taps the tablet.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "A blue glow lights his face.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "A text appears on screen:", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "ON TABLET: \"Kip's on the door.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Kim's got the cameras.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "You've got 4 minutes.\"", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Kip. Kim. Kip. Kim. Why do they both sound the same.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to himself"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "He pockets the key.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Crosses to the front desk, where a night janitor in headphones mops the floor, oblivious, humming.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo ducks behind a rack of kettlebells.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor sways closer, closer, then turns away.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good. Go. Go home.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["whispering"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor stops.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes off one earphone.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo freezes.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "A phone BUZZES somewhere.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor answers it, laughs, wanders toward the back office, still talking.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo exhales.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Moves.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "At the back of the gym he finds the glass trophy case.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside: a small gold dumbbell, \"1987 Regional Powerlifting Champion.\"", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "He reads the plaque and laughs once.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Big Dave's dumbbell. Unbelievable.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes out the old key.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Slides it into the lock.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "It does not turn.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "He tries again.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing.", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Come on come on come on", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "His thumb catches.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "The lock CLICKS.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "The glass door swings open.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts the dumbbell carefully.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "It's heavier than it looks.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "He weighs it in his hand, looking at it the way a man looks at the thing that is about to change his life.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "The tablet BUZZES again.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "He glances.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "ON TABLET: \"Kip says there's a guy outside.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Big.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Beard.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Holding a coffee.\"", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Big Dave.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["a whisper"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "He shoves the dumbbell into the bag.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Zips it.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks around for an exit.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "The front is out.", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "The side door is alarmed.", "para": 14, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "The only way is through the pool area, and past the janitor, who has begun to sing along to whatever is in his headphones.", "para": 14, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo crouches.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Creeps along the wall of treadmills.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "A treadmill SCREAMS to life as he brushes the start button, belt spinning, display lights flashing.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "He slaps the stop button.", "para": 15, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "It keeps going.", "para": 15, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No no no no.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor stops singing.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Footsteps approach from the back office.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo dives behind the juice bar, hugging the bag.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor appears, scratches his head at the roaring treadmill, and hits the emergency stop with the flat of his hand.", "para": 16, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 16, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "The janitor mutters something in Spanish, puts his earphone back in, and goes back to mopping.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo breathes.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Counts to ten.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Then slides out from behind the bar and makes for the pool doors, the bag bumping his hip.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "At the pool doors he hesitates.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Through the glass: a figure in the water, swimming slow laps in the dark.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "A woman, silver cap, goggles.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "She doesn't look up.", "para": 19, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Mo slips past on the tile, one hand on the wall.", "para": 19, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "He reaches the fire door.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Presses the bar.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "It opens without a sound.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "The alarm does not go off.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Kim.", "name": "MO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["realising"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "He steps out into the cold.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "The door CLOSES softly behind him.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}]}